+41 , DEF +30","effectLabel":"Covered Strike improved","effectText":"Range expands, and attacks have a 15% chance to inflict Cold for 1.5s, but Attack Interval increases slightly.","cost":[{"name":"Module Data Block","quantity":1},{"name":"Data Supplement Stick","quantity":15},{"name":"RMA70-12","quantity":5},{"name":"LMD","quantity":25000}]},{"stage":"Stage 3","attributesIncreased":"ATK +50 , DEF +35","effectLabel":"Covered Strike improved","effectText":"Range expands, and attacks have a 25% chance to inflict Cold for 1.5s, but Attack Interval increases slightly.","cost":[{"name":"Module Data Block","quantity":1},{"name":"Data Supplement Instrument","quantity":5},{"name":"Coagulating Gel","quantity":6},{"name":"LMD","quantity":30000}]}]}],"review":{"official":"Frostleaf is a former\nColumbian\nJunior Army soldier, \"retired\" after her unit was destroyed. Came into contact with\nRhodes Island\nlater as a mercenary, before officially joining following a period of collaboration with the company.\nExtensive combat experience and undeniably skilled, Frostleaf is an excellent asset to Rhodes Island.","editor":null,"rating":null},"synergies":[],"techniques":[{"technique":null,"techniqueDescription":null,"description":null}],"guides":[],"stats":{"phases":[{"elite":0,"minLevel":1,"maxLevel":45,"base":{"hp":949,"atk":272,"def":154,"res":5,"redeploy":70,"dp":16,"block":2,"interval":1.3},"max":{"hp":1356,"atk":400,"def":211,"res":5,"redeploy":70,"dp":16,"block":2,"interval":1.3},"rangeId":"2-3"},{"elite":1,"minLevel":1,"maxLevel":60,"base":{"hp":1356,"atk":400,"def":211,"res":10,"redeploy":70,"dp":18,"block":2,"interval":1.3},"max":{"hp":1785,"atk":534,"def":268,"res":10,"redeploy":70,"dp":18,"block":2,"interval":1.3},"rangeId":"3-12"},{"elite":2,"minLevel":1,"maxLevel":70,"base":{"hp":1785,"atk":534,"def":268,"res":10,"redeploy":70,"dp":18,"block":2,"interval":1.3},"max":{"hp":2260,"atk":660,"def":323,"res":10,"redeploy":70,"dp":18,"block":2,"interval":1.3},"rangeId":"3-12"}],"trust":{"hp":0,"atk":0,"def":55}},"files":[{"section":"Clinical Analysis","unlock":"Unlocked at 25 trust","description":"Imaging tests on this Operator showed blurry internal organs with clearly visible dark spots. Unusually high concentrations of Originium particles were present in her circulatory system, indicating infection and confirming her as Infected at this stage.\n\n[Cell-Originium Assimilation] 16% \nThe infection has advanced to mid-stage. Crystal formations are clearly visible on the operator's arms. \n\n[Blood Originium-Crystal Density] 0.35u/L\nLikely owing to her previous affiliation, Frostleaf's Oripathy had spread to such a degree by the time she joined Rhodes Island that I could not be optimistic about her chances. However, her current course of treatment has put her in a relatively stable condition. Hooray. Hooray.\n--Warfarin"},{"section":"Archive File 1","unlock":"Unlocked at 50 trust","description":"Frostleaf is something of a loner. One of our most combat experienced operators. \nShe dresses in hip, stylish outfits and enjoys listening to music alone in a quiet corner."},{"section":"Archive File 2","unlock":"Unlocked at 100 trust","description":"Frostleaf is one of the most experienced combatants in the entire company. The battlefield is like her own backyard. \nThat is not something to be terribly cheered about though, because it means, given her age, she never had a normal childhood. \nNot to mention, given Columbia's clashes with neighboring countries in the past decade and frequent skirmishes besides, one can easily imagine what kind of life Frostleaf has led. \nOlder operators still remember when Frostleaf first arrived, and report that she's a lot more outgoing now than she was then."},{"section":"Archive File 3","unlock":"Unlocked at 150 trust","description":"Rhodes Island recruited Frostleaf back when she was a mercenary, but upon her official admission, Dr. Kal'tsit ordered her to take only one mission--convalescing as a patient. \nThat presented a huge quandary, since Frostleaf up to this point had known nothing but war. \nFortunately, with help from the island's diverse population, Frostleaf gradually learned to enjoy life outside combat, which has opened her eyes to a whole new world."},{"section":"Archive File 4","unlock":"Unlocked at 200 trust","description":"After a considerable period of treatment and adapting to a life off the battlefield, Frostleaf thought she would return again to the world of war. She sought clearance from Dr. Kal'tsit but was denied a full release. Instead, Kal'tsit granted her permission for just one excursion. \nFrostleaf confidently strode into battle, eager to fight again, only to discover how difficult it had become for her to swing a weapon at an enemy. She later confessed that she was overwhelmed by the memory of her struggles in the Junior Army, something she thought she had completely left behind her. \nShe audibly wept on the field that day. \nFrom then on, Frostleaf slowly turned into what she is now: a music lover, a fashionista, and a bit of a loner."}]},"appearances":[{"label":"Base","iconPath":"/four-star-icons/Frostleaf%20-%20Base.webp","fullPath":"/four-star-skins/Frostleaf%20-%20Base.webp"},{"label":"Elite 2","iconPath":"/four-star-icons/Frostleaf%20-%20Elite%202.webp","fullPath":"/four-star-skins/Frostleaf%20-%20Elite%202.webp"},{"label":"Breaking the Ice","iconPath":"/four-star-icons/Frostleaf%20-%20Breaking%20the%20Ice.webp","fullPath":"/four-star-skins/Frostleaf%20-%20Breaking%20the%20Ice.webp"}],"skinObtainByLabel":{},"synergyMatches":[],"autoSynergyGroups":[{"name":"Rhodes Island","type":"faction","entries":[{"operatorName":"Closure","operatorIconPath":"/six-star-icons/Closure%20-%20Base.webp","isContributor":true,"badges":[{"label":"T2","skillIconPath":null,"talentLabel":"T2","sourceText":"Minimum DP -4 ( -1 ) when Closure is in the squad; all [Rhodes Island] Operators ATK +4%.","matchedKeyword":"Rhodes Island"}]},{"operatorName":"Kal'tsit