null},{"name":"Gladiia","rarity":6,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Lappland the Decadenza","rarity":6,"isFuture":null}],"totalCount":19},"Bind":{"entries":[{"name":"Dorothy","rarity":6,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Gladiia","rarity":6,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Muelsyse","rarity":6,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Ines","rarity":6,"isFuture":null}],"totalCount":24}},"forms":null,"skillRanges":null,"overviewRanges":[{"elite":0,"talent":null,"range":{"cols":3,"rows":3,"opCell":[2,1],"rangeCells":[[1,1],[1,2],[2,2],[2,3],[3,1],[3,2]]}},{"elite":1,"talent":null,"range":{"cols":4,"rows":3,"opCell":[2,1],"rangeCells":[[1,1],[1,2],[2,2],[2,3],[2,4],[3,1],[3,2]]}},{"elite":2,"talent":"Covered Strike","range":{"cols":4,"rows":3,"opCell":[2,1],"rangeCells":[[1,1],[1,2],[1,3],[2,2],[2,3],[2,4],[3,1],[3,2],[3,3]]}}],"voiceData":{"textLocale":"en","lines":[{"id":"CN_001","title":"Appointed as Assistant","text":"Want to listen to some music? I'll lend you my headphones.","category":"profile","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":1},{"id":"CN_002","title":"Talk 1","text":"Sorry, please keep a little distance from me.","category":"profile","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":2},{"id":"CN_003","title":"Talk 2","text":"I never imagined that I'd have the chance to become a rescue worker.","category":"profile","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":3},{"id":"CN_004","title":"Talk 3","text":"I picked up this axe a long time ago, maybe even before I learned to read.","category":"profile","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":4},{"id":"CN_005","title":"Talk after Promotion 1","text":"The songs I like are probably not so popular. They're only good for humming to myself when I'm alone.","category":"profile","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":5},{"id":"CN_006","title":"Talk after Promotion 2","text":"Don't blink—you have but one moment to witness this epic move.","category":"profile","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":6},{"id":"CN_007","title":"Talk after Trust Increase 1","text":"Want something to drink? My treat. You should relax a bit after work, you know.","category":"profile","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":7},{"id":"CN_008","title":"Talk after Trust Increase 2","text":"I only realized how precious life is after everyone around me died, one by one. Ironic, huh? I think so, too.","category":"profile","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":8},{"id":"CN_009","title":"Talk after Trust Increase 3","text":"I'm a mercenary. I just do my job. As for the purpose of my mission and its consequences, I don't have a say in any of that. So, from now on, all my responsibilities are your concern.","category":"profile","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":9},{"id":"CN_010","title":"Idle","text":"Dun... dun dun♪dun... dun dun...♪","category":"profile","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":10},{"id":"CN_011","title":"Onboard","text":"Frostleaf, former mercenary. From now on, I'm your operator. Assign me any job you want, I can do pretty much anything.","category":"profile","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":11},{"id":"CN_012","title":"Watching Battle Record","text":"Thanks.","category":"profile","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":12},{"id":"CN_013","title":"Promotion 1","text":"Things are on the right track now.","category":"profile","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":13},{"id":"CN_014","title":"Promotion 2","text":"Whew... not bad. Feeling fulfilled for the first time in a while.","category":"profile","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":14},{"id":"CN_017","title":"Added to Squad","text":"I'll do my job.","category":"combat","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":17},{"id":"CN_018","title":"Appointed as Squad Leader","text":"Go your own ways and do your own jobs.","category":"combat","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":18},{"id":"CN_019","title":"Depart","text":"Great, I feel like some exercise.","category":"combat","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":19},{"id":"CN_020","title":"Begin Operation","text":"You will shatter.","category":"combat","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":20},{"id":"CN_021","title":"Selecting Operator 1","text":"Hmm?","category":"combat","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":21},{"id":"CN_022","title":"Selecting Operator 2","text":"Your orders?","category":"combat","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":22},{"id":"CN_023","title":"Deployment 1","text":"This should work.","category":"combat","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":23},{"id":"CN_024","title":"Deployment 2","text":"Hm, okay.","category":"combat","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":24},{"id":"CN_025","title":"In Battle 1","text":"My bodily fluids aren't the only thing that's chilling.","category":"combat","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":25},{"id":"CN_026","title":"In Battle 2","text":"Extend my edge!","category":"combat","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":26},{"id":"CN_027","title":"In Battle 3","text":"Life, brittle as frost, fragile like leaves.","category":"combat","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":27},{"id":"CN_028","title":"In Battle 4","text":"Let's chill down some hot heads.","category":"combat","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":28},{"id":"CN_029","title":"4-star Result","text":"I've been through countless battles... seen the carnage, witnessed the silent nothingness at the end.","category":"combat","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":29},{"id":"CN_030","title":"3-star Result","text":"I remember every enemy I fought. Not a single one escapes.","category":"combat","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":30},{"id":"CN_031","title":"Sub 3-star Result","text":"We didn't lose anyone, did we?","category":"combat","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":31},{"id":"CN_032","title":"Operation Failure","text":"I'll hold up the rear.","category":"combat","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":32},{"id":"CN_033","title":"Assigned to Facility","text":"I'd like... a more private space.","category":"profile","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":33},{"id":"CN_034","title":"Tap","text":"Ow.","category":"profile","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":34},{"id":"CN_036","title":"Trust Tap","text":"How about a drink?","category":"profile","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":36},{"id":"CN_037","title":"Title","text":"Arknights.","category":"profile","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":37},{"id":"CN_038","title":"New Year's blessing","text":"I never celebrated any holiday like this before coming to Rhodes Island. Even on a peaceful New Year's, I wouldn't have a room as safe and warm as this... Sorry, Doctor, can I just—listen to some music on my own for a while? I'll come and catch you in a bit. Thank you.","category":"special","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":38},{"id":"CN_042","title":"Greeting","text":"Doctor...","category":"special","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":42},{"id":"CN_043","title":"Birthday","text":"Happy birthday, Doctor. Here's a charm I made for you. Inside it are some lyrics I extracted from a song, the one I always listen to when I'm feeling down. I hope it'll protect you from any hurt enemies might deal you. Oh, it's coming on too heavy? Not at all. Life's the most important thing, trust me on that.","category":"special","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":43},{"id":"CN_044","title":"Anniversary Celebration","text":"You don't need to be too worried. My past experiences weren't all bad. They taught me what living wrongly looked like. And my time at Rhodes Island has made me want to stick even harder with this all-new outlook, to explore even more unknown places across the lands. Maybe you'd wanna come with me, Doctor.","category":"special","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":44}],"packs":[{"id":"en","label":"English","actors":["Ina Marie Smith"],"status":"current","audioTemplate":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/arkpedia/arkpedia-voice-english/main/current/char_193_frostl/{voiceIdLower}.mp3"},{"id":"jp","label":"Japanese","actors":["Ai Kakuma"],"status":"current","audioTemplate":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/arkpedia/arkpedia-voice-japanese/main/current/char_193_frostl/{voiceIdLower}.mp3"},{"id":"cn","label":"Mandarin","actors":["Ruan "],"status":"current","audioTemplate":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/arkpedia/arkpedia-voice-mandarin/main/current/char_193_frostl/{voiceIdLower}.mp3"},{"id":"kr","label":"Korean","actors":["Jang Mi"],"status":"current","audioTemplate":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/arkpedia/arkpedia-voice-korean/main/current/char_193_frostl/{voiceIdLower}.mp3"}]}}}